The three cycles are implemented and committed. A direct CLI check refuses the unapproved evaluator pin without writing output.

I found one specification issue for the later pinning review: the producer’s full imported closure includes `exp04_profiles.py`. Storing that closure’s digest inside the same file creates a circular hash dependency. I’ve preserved the requested full-closure check and left the approval pin unset; the review will need to settle where that pin lives.
